mobile/dist/
mobile/web/tests/parity/*.json

# ─── Research artefacts (tracked with DVC, see research/README.md) ────
# The files live in the DVC store; git keeps only the small pointers
# (*.dvc, dvc.lock), the model registry and the evaluation summary.
# DVC writes data/.gitignore and models/.gitignore for what it tracks. Do not
# ignore /data or /models here: DVC skips git-ignored folders and would then
# not see data/*.dvc.
/reports/*
!/reports/eval_test.json
!/reports/eval_test.md
!/reports/agreement.json
